<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Pepsi-Gemex raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pepsi-Gemex raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Reserach raised its rating on Mexican beverage company Grupo Embotellador de Mexico SA de CV (Pepsi-Gemex) to a buy from market performer.</p>
<p>The PepsiCo Inc bottler turned in its best operating performance since the 1994 peso crisis during the second quarter, Caspian said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Soon we will be revising up our estimates on Pepsi-Gemex, incorporating this 2Q97 solid operating performance,&quot; Caspian said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
